> 2011/5/11 Christoph Bergmeir<christoph...@gmail.com>:
>> Hello everybody,
>>
>> I just committed some code to github that should fix the problems.
>>
>> - The warning was indeed because somewhere in the code there was a hard
>> coded "3" that should be #lags+1
>> - The error is caused by underdetermined linear systems. lm then gives NAs
>> that lead to errors later. My solution is to use ginv instead of lm.
>> Hopefully, this doesn't cause trouble elsewhere.
>>
>> @Matthieu: I sent you a pull request in github..
>>
>>
>>>> On the other side, I observe a very strange behavior I cannot
>>>> understand...
