Christoph

Thanks for checking and solving so fast, great!

On the ginv issue: I use somewhere a try() and test, which might be a
solution as: by default use lm.fit() (or solve in my case), and if
problem use ginv(), see:
  VVinv<-try(solve(VV), silent=TRUE)
       if(inherits(VVinv, "try-error")) VVinv<-ginv(VV)

On the star -> linear issue: indeed, would be nice if you could then
return a ar (see function linear() ) when 1 regime only!

Thanks!!

Mat

